{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {"type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --"},
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Detailansicht eines MySQL Router — Routen, Verbindungen, Durchsatz, Metadata Cache",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": ["mysql-router"],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Übersicht",
      "tooltip": "Zurück zur Multi-Router-Übersicht",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "url": ""
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Erreichbarkeit des MySQL Routers über die REST API.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🟢 Up (1) — Router antwortet auf REST-API-Anfragen\n- 🔴 Down (0) — keine Verbindung; alle Metriken veraltet oder fehlend\n\nBei Down wird der Exporter `mysql_router_up 0` pushen und alle Route-Metriken aussetzen.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {"color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "Down"},
                "1": {"color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "Up"}
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "mysql_router_up{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Router Status",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Laufzeit des MySQL Router-Prozesses seit dem letzten Start.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🔴 < 5 Min (300 s) — kürzlich neu gestartet; Absturz oder geplante Wartung prüfen\n- 🟡 5–60 Min (300–3.600 s) — Stabilisierungsphase\n- 🟢 ≥ 1 Stunde (3.600 s) — stabiler Betrieb\n\nEin Uptime-Reset ohne geplante Wartung ist immer ein Warnsignal.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 300},
              {"color": "green", "value": 3600}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 0},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "mysql_router_uptime_seconds{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Uptime",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Uptime",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Summe aktiver Client-TCP-Verbindungen über die ausgewählten Routen.\n\nEine Verbindung zählt als aktiv, solange die TCP-Session offen ist — auch während MySQL `SLEEP`-Phasen. Sehr viele aktive Verbindungen bei geringer CPU-Last auf dem MySQL-Server deuten auf fehlenden Connection-Pool hin.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🟢 < 50 — normale Last\n- 🟡 50–199 — erhöhte Last; Connection-Pool-Konfiguration prüfen\n- 🔴 ≥ 200 — Sättigungsrisiko; MySQL `max_connections` kann erschöpft werden",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 50},
              {"color": "red", "value": 200}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 0},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "sum(mysql_router_route_active_connections{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Aktiv",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Aktive Verbindungen",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Rate neuer TCP-Verbindungsaufbauten pro Sekunde über alle gewählten Routen (2-Min-Fenster).\n\nJede neue Verbindung erfordert TCP-Handshake + MySQL-Authentifizierung. Ohne Connection-Pool erzeugt jede Applikationsanfrage eine neue Verbindung.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🟢 < 10/s — normal; Connection-Pool aktiv\n- 🟡 10–49/s — erhöht; Pooling-Konfiguration prüfen\n- 🔴 ≥ 50/s — kritisch; signifikanter MySQL-Overhead, Latenzen steigen",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 10},
              {"color": "red", "value": 50}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 0},
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "sum(irate(mysql_router_route_total_connections_total{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"}[2m]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Neu/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Neue Verbindungen/s",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Ergebnis des letzten Metadata-Cache-Refreshes (Minimum über alle Metadata-Instanzen).\n\nDer Metadata Cache hält die InnoDB-Cluster-Topologie aktuell. Bei Fehler arbeitet der Router mit veralteten Routing-Informationen — ein Primary-Failover wird dann nicht erkannt.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🟢 OK (1) — letzter Refresh erfolgreich\n- 🔴 Fehler (0) — Cluster-Konnektivität vom Router-Host aus prüfen",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {"color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "Fehler"},
                "1": {"color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "OK"}
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "min(clamp_max(increase(mysql_router_metadata_refresh_succeeded_total{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\"}[5m]), 1))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Metadata",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Metadata Cache",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Zeit seit dem letzten erfolgreichen Metadata-Cache-Refresh in Sekunden.\n\nDer Standard-Refresh-Interval beträgt 5 Sekunden. Steigt dieser Wert, hat der Router die Cluster-Topologie nicht aktualisiert und weiss nicht über Failover-Ereignisse Bescheid.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🟢 < 60 s — aktuell (≤ 12 ausgelassene Refreshes tolerable)\n- 🟡 60–299 s — veraltet; Netzwerk zwischen Router und Cluster-Nodes prüfen\n- 🔴 ≥ 300 s — kritisch; Routing-Entscheidungen sind seit > 5 Min nicht mehr verlässlich",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 60},
              {"color": "red", "value": 300}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 15, "y": 0},
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "mysql_router_metadata_last_refresh_age_seconds{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Letzter Metadata Refresh — vor",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Health-Status pro Route: Hat die Route mindestens einen erreichbaren Backend-MySQL-Node?\n\nEine Route ist unhealthy wenn alle zugehörigen Backend-Nodes ausgefallen oder nicht erreichbar sind. Clients erhalten dann sofort Verbindungsfehler statt einer MySQL-Verbindung.\n\n**Grenzwerte:**\n- 🟢 Healthy (1) — mindestens ein Backend-Node verfügbar\n- 🔴 Unhealthy (0) — kein Backend-Node verfügbar; InnoDB-Cluster-Status prüfen",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {"color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "Unhealthy"},
                "1": {"color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "Healthy"}
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "mysql_router_route_health{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Route Health",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Zeitlicher Verlauf aktiver Client-Verbindungen pro Route.\n\nErmöglicht die Analyse von Lastmustern: Unterschied zwischen RW- und RO-Verbindungen, Lastspitzen durch Batch-Jobs, Verbindungsaufbau nach Deployments.\n\n**Grenzwerte (horizontale Linien):**\n- 🟡 50 — erhöhte Last; Connection-Pooling prüfen\n- 🔴 200 — kritische Sättigung; MySQL `max_connections` könnte erschöpft werden\n\nRO-Routen sollten bei Read-Heavy-Workloads deutlich mehr Verbindungen haben als RW-Routen.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "Verbindungen",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": {"legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false},
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"},
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"},
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "line"}
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 50},
              {"color": "red", "value": 200}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4},
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max", "mean"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "mysql_router_route_active_connections{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "Active"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Aktive Verbindungen pro Route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Rate neuer TCP-Verbindungen pro Sekunde und Route (2-Min-Fenster).\n\nDer Kumulativzähler `total_connections_total` wird mit `irate()` in eine Rate umgerechnet. Diese Metrik ist der empfindlichste Indikator für fehlende Connection-Pools.\n\n**Grenzwerte (horizontale Linien):**\n- 🟡 10/s — erhöht; Applikations-Connection-Pool konfigurieren oder vergrößern\n- 🔴 50/s — kritisch; jede neue Verbindung kostet ~1–5 ms für Authentifizierung",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "Verbindungen/s",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {"legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false},
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"},
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"},
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "line"}
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 10},
              {"color": "red", "value": 50}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4},
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max", "mean"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "irate(mysql_router_route_total_connections_total{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"}[2m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Neue Verbindungen/s pro Route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Datendurchsatz vom MySQL-Server zum Client (Lesedaten / Result-Sets) in Bytes/s pro Route (2-Min-Fenster).\n\nHohe RX-Werte auf RO-Routen sind bei Read-Heavy-Workloads erwartet. Dauerhaft hohe Werte können auf große `SELECT *`-Queries ohne LIMIT oder fehlende Pagination hinweisen.\n\n**Grenzwerte (horizontale Linien):**\n- 🟡 10 MB/s — erhöhter Durchsatz; Query-Analyse empfohlen\n- 🔴 100 MB/s — kritisch; Netzwerk- oder MySQL-IO-Engpass prüfen; Slow-Query-Log aktivieren",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "Bytes/s",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": {"legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false},
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"},
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"},
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "line"}
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 10485760},
              {"color": "red", "value": 104857600}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12},
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull", "mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "irate(mysql_router_route_bytes_from_server_total{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"}[2m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "RX"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Durchsatz vom Server — RX (Client ← Server)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Datendurchsatz vom Client zum MySQL-Server (Queries / INSERT-Daten) in Bytes/s pro Route (2-Min-Fenster).\n\nHohe TX-Werte auf der RW-Route sind bei schreibintensiven Workloads normal. TX-Spitzen auf RO-Routen deuten auf falsch geroutete Schreiboperationen hin — Applikations-Konfiguration prüfen.\n\n**Grenzwerte (horizontale Linien):**\n- 🟡 10 MB/s — erhöhter Schreibdurchsatz\n- 🔴 100 MB/s — kritisch; mögliche unkontrollierte LOAD DATA / Bulk-INSERTs",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "Bytes/s",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": {"legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false},
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"},
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"},
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "line"}
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 10485760},
              {"color": "red", "value": 104857600}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12},
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull", "mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
          "expr": "irate(mysql_router_route_bytes_to_server_total{job=\"mysql_router\", instance=\"$instance\", route=~\"$route\"}[2m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "TX"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Durchsatz zum Server — TX (Client → Server)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}"},
      "description": "Detaillierter Snapshot aller Routen mit vollständiger Ampel-Färbung.\n\n**Spalten:**\n- **Health** — 🟢 Healthy / 🔴 Unhealthy\n- **Aktive Verbindungen** — 🟢 <50 / 🟡 50–199 / 🔴 ≥200\n- **Blocked Hosts** — 🟢 0 / 🔴 ≥1\n- **Destinations** — 🔴 0 (kein Backend) / 🟡 1 (kein HA) / 🟢 ≥2 (redundant)\n- **Neue Verbindungen/s** — 🟢 <10 / 🟡 10–49 / 🔴 ≥50\n- **RX/TX Bytes/s** — Durchsatz in beide Richtungen",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {"type": "auto"},
            "inspect": false
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "Health"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": {"type": "color-background"}},
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {"color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "Unhealthy"},
